{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16091","headline":"题石瓮寺 · 王建","name":"题石瓮寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青崖白石夹城东，泉脉钟声内里通。\n地压龙蛇山色别，屋连宫殿匠名同。\n檐灯经夏纱笼黑，溪叶先秋腊树红。\n天子亲题诗总在，画扉长鏁碧龛中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}